    "text": " Three months of silence from ATFRO. You deserve to know what we have been doing. We have been busy with client work without showing the process. And this is a mistake which we are correcting. Not dressing it up as a strategy. We have dealt with school communications, doctor-led content, and practical software systems. Different projects. Still the same question. What's stopping this business from growing? That's what being a growth partner means to us. Understand the problem. Build what is useful and grow with the people who are running the business.",
